  "details": "In some worlds the over head space can become cluttered with everyone displaying personal data, such as heartbeat and current spotify music. This can be rather annoying to see as it is just spam and doesn't help anyone.\n\nTurning off chat to everyone but friends stops people from having the option to talk via the in game chat box. therefore i cannot turn it off without impacting communication to some players and friends.\n\nHaving the option to mute their chatbox too would greatly help this issues and shouldn't add more clutter to the ui if it is under a moderation section on a user once you select them in game. This will alllow me to remove clutter when and where i need to and allow me to freely communicate to people who are using the tool as inteneded",
